        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushondo gwa kabili gukashohora guli gw'oruganda rwa Simeoni. Nk'okwo amahiga garwo gali, ensi yabo yagobaga omu y'oruganda rwa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obusika bwabo bwinamu ebigo ebi: Beerisheba, Sheba, Molada; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazarishuali, Bala, Ezemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elitoladi, Betuli, Horima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zikilagi, Betimarikoboti, Hazarisusa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Betilebaoti na Sharuheni. Bigo ikumi na bishatu n'ebyaro byabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haliho Aini, Rimoni, Eteri na Ashani. Bigo binai n'ebyaro byabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu hakaba halimu ebyaro byona ebyabaire byataine ebigo ebyo kugoba Baalatibeori, Rama eya Negebu. Obu nibwo bwabaire buli busika bw'oruganda rwa Simeoni nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obusika bwabo bukaruga aha kichweka ky'ensi ya Yuda, aha rw'okuba omushondo gw'oruganda rwa Yuda gukaba guli guhango muno ahali bonene. Nikyo bashalirweho ekichweka kikatwarwa oruganda rwa Simeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushondo gwa kashatu gukashohora guli gwa baijukuru ba Zebuluni, nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali. Obusika bwabo nibugoba Saridi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi orubibi rwabo nirugendera kimoi obugwaizoba kulemwa kugoba Marala, kukwata Dabesheti, rukagoba aha kaiga k'oburugaizoba bwa Yoneamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruruga Saridi rugya rubaju orundi orw'oburugaizoba rugoba orubibi rwa Kisilotitabori; rushuba rugoba Daberati, aho rugendera kimoi Yafia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwema okwo rwolekera oburugaizoba rugoba Gatiheferi, rugya Etikazini, rushoholera Rimoni, ruhenda rugiire Nea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ruzingora rubaju orwa bikara rugoba Hanatoni, rulekelera aha Ruhanga rwa Ifutaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi y'oruganda rwa Zabuloni einamu Katati, Nahalali, Shimuroni, Idala na Betelehemu n'ebigo ebindi: Byona hamoi 12 n'ebyaro byabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nibwo busika bwa baijukuru ba Zebuluni nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali: Ebigo ebi n'ebyaro byabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushondo gwa kanai gukashohora guli gw'oruganda rwa Isakari, nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yabo ekaba einamu Yezireeli, Kesuloti, Shunemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hafaraimu, Shioni, Anaharati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabiti, Kishioni, Ebezi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remeti, Enganimu, Enihada na Betipazezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubibi nirugoba Tabori, Shahazuma na Betishemeshi. Nirulekelera Yorudani. Ebigo byayo byona hamoi 16 n'ebyaro byabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nibwo busika bwa baijukuru ba Isakari nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali, ebigo n'ebyaro byabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushondo gwa katanu gukashohora guli gw'oruganda rwa Asheri nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yabo ekaba einamu ebigo ebi: Helikati, Hali, Beteni, Akishafu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alameleki, Amadi na Mishali. Obugwaizoba orubibi nirugoba Karimeli na Shihorilibunati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ruzingora rwolekeire oburugaizoba rugiire Betidagoni, rugoba Zebuluni n'omu Ruhanga rwa Ifutaeli bwolekera bikara rugoba Betiemeki na Neyeli. Rushuba rugendera kimoi rugoba Kabuli rubaju orwa bikara, na ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eburoni, Rehobu, Hamoni na Kana, rugoba Sidoni enkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruzingora rugiire Rama, rugoba ekigo kya Tiro eky'eboma, rumara ruhenda rwolekeire Hosa. Rulekelera aha Nyanja ya Mediterania. Ensi ya Asheri einamu ebigo 22, ebimoiho ni Mehebeli, Akizibu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma, Afeka na Rehobu n'ebyaro byabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nibwo busika bwa baijukuru ba Asheri nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali, ebigo ebyo n'ebyaro byabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushondo gwa mukaga gukashohora guli gwa baijukuru ba Nafutali, nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubibi rwabo rwayemaga Helefu aha muti gw'omwaloni omuli Zananimu, Adaminekebu na Yabineeli rugoba Yakumu, rulekelera aha Mwiga gwa Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho orubibi ruhindukira obugwaizoba rugoba Azinotitabori rushuba rugendera kimoi rugoba Hukoki, na Zabuloni rubaju orwa kasi, na Asheri rubaju orw'obugwaizoba, na Yuda oburugaizoba bwa Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo ebiina eboma ni Zidimu, Zeri, Hamati, Rakati na Kinereti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adama, Rama, Hazori; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedeshi, Edirei, Enihazori; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yironi, Migidalieli, Horemu, Betanati na Betishemeshi. Ebigo 19 n'ebyaro byabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nibwo busika bw'oruganda rwa Nafutali nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali, ebigo n'ebyaro byabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushondo gwa mushanju gukashohora guli gw'oruganda rwa baijukuru ba Dani nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obusika bwabo bulimu Zora, Eshitaoli, Irishemeshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaalabini, Aiyaloni na Itila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eloni, Timuna, Ekironi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliteke, Gibetoni, Baalati; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehudi, Beneberaki, Gatirimoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meyarikoni na Rakoni hamoi n'ensi elebangaine na Yopa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Abadani banyagirwe ensi yabo bagenda batera Leshemu. Kabamazire kukwata ekigo ekyo, abamwo babaisa embanda, aho bakituramu. Bakakyeta Dani, nibakyetelera Dani omugurusi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nibwo busika bwa baijukuru ba Dani nk'okwo amahiga gabo gali, ebigo ebi n'ebyaro byabyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
